OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhat is PHP and why did it spark a
OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security scramble?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernments and cyber-security agencies
OL,7,Frushed to contain the fallout, urging
OL,8,Fwebsite owners to check if their sites
OL,9,Fwere affected and, if so, install
OL,10,Fupdates to patch the issue or consider
OL,11,Fgoing offline.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
