OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors - paranoia deepens
OL,4,Aas traitor behaviour splits opinion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe snoozefest - which involved
OL,7,Freluctant traitor James Acaster making
OL,8,Ffaithful Ross Kemp yawn by boring him
OL,9,Fto tears - meant the paranoid
OL,10,FEastEnders star was finally put out of
OL,11,Fhis misery.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
