OL,3,AUS actor Tom Skerritt, star of Top Gun,
OL,4,ASteel Magnolias and Alien, dies aged 93
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a six-decade career, he appeared in
OL,7,Fthe film Mash, A River Runs Through It
OL,8,Fand Ted. He also co-founded
OL,9,FTheFilmSchool in Seattle to support
OL,10,Fnext-generation filmmakers and
OL,11,Fstorytellers.
OL,13,FHis family said he will be remembered
OL,14,F"for his belief that stories can help
OL,15,Fpeople heal, find purpose and create
OL,16,Fchange".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
